@startuml seq_flt_line_pressure_sensor
title SC-FLT-04 - Line pressure sensor out of range: limp-home

actor "Console user" as User
participant "Console" as Console
participant "Plant model" as Plant
participant "TCU" as TCU
participant "Red LED\n(TCU board)" as LED

note over User, LED
Covers: SYS-SEN-004, SYS-SEN-006, SYS-FLT-002, SYS-FLT-003, SYS-FLT-004, SYS-FLT-008, SYS-FLT-001, SYS-HMI-001, SIM-CON-003, SG-04
CAN frames pass can0 / slcand / gateway transparently (DC-05, SIM-GW-001), see SC-STA-04.
Valid electrical range 200 .. 4800 mV (can_matrix section 4).
end note

note over TCU: control active, mode Normal
User -> Console : force LinePressVoltage (0 mV or 5000 mV) (SIM-CON-003)
Console -> Plant : sensor voltage forced
Plant -> TCU : SIM_Analog: LinePressVoltage outside 200 .. 4800 mV (t0)
loop every 10 ms
  Plant -> TCU : SIM_Analog: LinePressVoltage outside 200 .. 4800 mV
end
... longer than 100 ms ...
TCU -> TCU : t0 + 100 ms: line pressure sensor fault (FaultBits 4, DTC P0840-1C)\n(SYS-SEN-004) -> enter limp-home, latched (SYS-FLT-002, SYS-FLT-004)
TCU -> Plant : TCU_Actuators: SS_A = OFF, SS_B = OFF, PCS_Duty = 0 %, FaultLamp = ON (SYS-FLT-001)
note right of TCU: <= 100 ms after the fault is set (SYS-FLT-003)
TCU -> LED : ON (SYS-HMI-001)
TCU -> Plant : TCU_Status: Mode = 1 (Limp-home), FaultBits bit 4 = 1
note over Plant, TCU: Safe state of SG-04: limp-home.
note over TCU: pressure plausibility suspended while the line pressure\nsensor fault is set: no pressure fault (bit 3) (SYS-SEN-006)

User -> Console : remove the injection
Plant -> TCU : SIM_Analog: LinePressVoltage within 200 .. 4800 mV
TCU -> TCU : the fault stays set until the next power cycle (SYS-FLT-008),\nlimp-home stays latched (SYS-FLT-004)
@enduml
